+\code{make_binary128_complex_source(real, imag)} wrappers import components
+without depending on extended \code{std::complex} support.  Supported native
+types are selected by capability traits: binary80 accepts a verified
+\code{long double} or \code{_Float64x} representation; binary128 accepts
+\code{_Float128}, \code{__float128}, or a verified binary128
